# Environment variables for ZEmu Launcher
#
# ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ IMPORTANT: These vars are DEV ONLY.                                       │
# │                                                                          │
# │ Production URLs are hardcoded in `src/config/launcher.ts`                │
# │ (LAUNCHER_CONFIG.*) and baked into the bundle at build time. You do NOT   │
# │ need to set anything for `pnpm tauri build` or the release workflow to    │
# │ produce a working build pointing at https://*.zemu.uk.                   │
# │                                                                          │
# │ The `VITE_*` vars below exist so contributors running `pnpm dev:vite`    │
# │ can redirect the launcher at a local checkout of `zemu-website`          │
# │ (apps/auth, apps/api, apps/realtime) without round-tripping through      │
# │ production. They are read at `pnpm dev:vite` startup; production         │
# │ bundles ignore them entirely. The `.env.local` file is gitignored so     │
# │ personal overrides never get committed.                                  │
# └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# ─── Frontend / Vite (VITE_ prefix — dev-only overrides for pnpm dev:vite) ──
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3003
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3002
# VITE_LAUNCHER_REALTIME_URL=ws://localhost:3007
#
# ─── Backend / Rust (no prefix — dev-only, read at `pnpm tauri dev` start) ──
#
# ZEMU_GAME_SERVER
#   Game server hostname:port passed to the game at launch.
#   Default (prod): eu.zemu.uk:1115
#   Example (local): 127.0.0.1:1115
#ZEMU_GAME_SERVER=eu.zemu.uk:1115
